=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** This quest will not appear on your quest list until completion.
* Speak to {n:Mertaire} at Merry Minstrel in {z:Lower Jeuno} (I-8).
* Speak to {n:Bki Tbujhja} at the counter in the same room in {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-8).
* Obtain a {i:Parchment|Parchment|917} from the Auction House (Leathercraft) or by crafting.
** {i:Parchment|Parchment|917} can also be bought from {n:Pikini-Mikini} in the warehouse in {z:Mhaura} (G-9) for just over 2,000 gil.
* Travel to {z:Buburimu Peninsula} at (G-9) and examine the {p:Song Runes} for a cutscene.
** To arrive at the location: go to the beach just west of {z:Mhaura} via the ramp at (H-9). Head to the southwest corner and into the water. There will be a tunnel which leads to the next beach area over, where you will find the {p:Song Runes}.
* Trade a {i:Parchment|Parchment|917} to the {p:Song Runes} in {z:Buburimu Peninsula} at (G-9) for a {i:Poetic Parchment|Poetic Parchment|634} and to complete the quest.

